      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "multi_az_helper.py logic:\n• Scale-up: count workers per AZ → launch in min-count AZ → balanced spread\n• Scale-down: drain from max-count AZ first → rebalances automatically\n• Result: AZ failure loses at most half workers, not all",
